// Package draw declares the 2D drawing primitives passCanvas emits into the
// draw function it extracts from a canvas. They are the intrinsic half of
// sngl:ui/draw, which declares the canvas and the shapes a program writes.
//
// Each declaration here is a signature with no body: the result is produced
// by the target's native implementation of the marked id, so a backend that
// does not implement one has nothing to fall back to.
